OL,3,GNEWSANearly 100 Child Sexual
OL,4,AExploitation cases investigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 98 child sexual exploitation
OL,7,Finvestigations are under way in
OL,8,FBirmingham, with six believed to
OL,9,Finvolve groups, a report to the city
OL,10,Fcouncil has revealed.
OL,12,FThe figures, from the independent
OL,13,FBirmingham Children's Trust, paint a
OL,14,Fpicture of what authorities are facing
OL,15,Fin trying to keep children safe in the
OL,16,Fcity.
OL,18,FThe national inquiry into child sexual
OL,19,Fabuse by grooming gangs has announced
OL,20,Fit will be expanded to include
OL,21,FBirmingham and Wales.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
